        "entry_778byy": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why has the Fitness Fan stopped working?",
            "text": "<p>This can be caused by:<br/><br/>1) No power supply. Check the power supply, cord, breakers, and fuses.<br/>2) Faulty power cord. Unplug and visually check the power cord. If damaged, have it repaired by qualified personnel or contact the customer care team.<br/>3) On/off switch in the wrong position. Move the switch to the \"I\" ON position.<br/>4) The on/off switch is faulty. Have the switch replaced by qualified personnel or contact the customer care team. </p>",
